      "value": "Getting the world scale for the player would be great! Often I need to scale content to suit the world scale, and at the moment there's no great way of doing that.\nIs this post related? https://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/provide-a-player-api-method-to-get-the-players-camera-scale-ipd",
